        <h2>PMKSY &amp; Per Drop More Crop (PDMC) Subsidy Breakdown</h2>
        <p>Under the Government of India’s <strong>Per Drop More Crop (PDMC)</strong> guidelines, financial assistance is calculated on indicative unit costs per hectare and transferred via Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT). Several states (such as Maharashtra, Gujarat, Andhra Pradesh, and Tamil Nadu) provide additional state top-ups above the central baseline.</p>

