          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-value">45%</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Other Farmers</span>
            <p class="stat-note">Medium and large landholders above 2 hectares.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-value">5 Ha</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Maximum Eligible Area</span>
            <p class="stat-note">Capped at 5 hectares per beneficiary, repeatable after 7 years.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="table-wrapper">
